  "revision": 1,
  "name": "teammate-agent",
  "description": "One teammate agent of one space (backlog:8986f4459f0f): a named agent with a role and working instructions plus an optional monthly spending cap in cents. Every row is managed: an agent exists only through the agents package create operation. (backlog:8986f4459f0f)",
